Since April, people have reported bookings on the wrong date. The desk merged them into #4471.
The export's parser model reads month first for day-first tenants, but booking-form hints and
unresolved timing reports describe different problems.

## Desk update after the snapshot

The tables below preserve the 4 October 2026 snapshot. The
[course desk update](https://hq.mega.dev/challenges/what-it-shows) dated 5 October 2026 reports
#4471 closed: parser FIXED, `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`; hint WON'T FIX,
booking-v3 form retired.

This is desk-reported production status. We have not tested the production parser or form.
The form was retired; its hint was not fixed. The five timing reports remain provisional and need their own
investigation; closure of #4471 does not establish their cause or resolution.

